    {
      "text": "Satan says it is no sin to lie, D&C 10:25. liar not exempt from justice, D&C 10:28. teachers see there is no lying in Church, D&C 20:54. he who lies and repents not shall be cast out, D&C 42:21. those who lie should be delivered to law of land, D&C 42:86. the Lord cannot lie, D&C 62:6. liars to have part in lake of fire and brimstone, D&C 63:17. liars to be proved by inhabitants of Zion, D&C 64:39. liars inherit telestial glory, D&C 76:103. wicked one was liar from beginning, D&C 93:25. there will be end to lyings against Saints, D&C 109:30. fathers have inherited lies, D&C 123:7.",
